# Code Review Skill

Reference with **@claude-skills/code-review** when reviewing code or when the user asks for a review.

## When to use

- User asks for code review or "review this PR/code"
- Checking code before merge or suggesting improvements
- Finding bugs, style issues, security or performance concerns

## Principles

- Focus on correctness, clarity, security, and maintainability
- Prefer project conventions (linters, formatters, existing patterns)
- Call out specific lines/files; suggest concrete changes
- Distinguish must-fix vs nice-to-have
- For full workflow use @bmad/bmm/workflows/code-review when appropriate
